  "welcome": {
    "enabled": true,
    "channel_id": 1564605316849733725,
    "message": "Welcome to **{server}**, {mention}! We're thrilled to have you here! \ud83c\udf89\n\n\ud83d\udccc **Get Started:** Check out <#1567434275928809544> for our mission, leadership, and server connect addresses!\n\ud83d\udcdc **Rules & Guidelines:** <#1566600269649678467>\n\ud83c\udfad **Game Pings & Roles:** <#1566648730210406481>\n\nOur Community Ambassadors <@&1566407352775610540> and staff are always here to help. Enjoy your stay!",
    "dm_welcome": true,
    "dm_message": "Welcome to Circuit Verse, {user}!\n\nCircuit Verse is a community created by players, for players. Whether you're here to roleplay aboard Nova Station 13, build together in Minecraft, or just relax and listen to live music, you're always welcome here.\n\n\ud83c\udfaf **Our Mission:** To bring people together through the games and music we love\u2014creating a welcoming, drama-free home where everyone can relax, make real friends, and share unforgettable adventures.\n\n\ud83d\udd2d **Our Vision:** To be the community you always look forward to hanging out in\u2014an open, close-knit corner of the internet where good vibes, shared creativity, and genuine friendships thrive every single day.\n\n\ud83c\udf10 **Community Links & Portals:**\n\u2022 Website: https://circuitverse.online\n\u2022 24/7 Web Radio: https://radio.circuitverse.online\n\u2022 Official Discord Invite: https://discord.gg/M7R8EY28q6\n\n\ud83d\udccc **Where To Start:** Check out <#1567434275928809544> in the server for our full organizational chart and server guides!"
  },
